The '''Barleycrest Farmstead''' is an abandoned farm located in the central [[Grim Reaches]]. Due to the resurgence of the [[Dragonmaw clan]], the Wildhammer farmers of the Grim Reaches have evacuated to [[Dun Kithas]], their fields left fallow.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|32|Provisions for War}}</ref>

